# Paths jittest will not spend money on, in addition to the built-in defaults.
# One glob per line. Matched against the repo-relative path and the basename.
#
# The built-in defaults already cover migrations, vendored code, node_modules,
# virtualenvs, build output, protobuf stubs, type stubs, docs and examples.

# Examples - uncomment what applies to you:
# legacy/*
# *_generated.py
# scripts/*
# src/myproject/experimental/*
